==Description==
The '''Actor1''', called the '''Actor''' in-game, was the first enemy that appeared in the third act of the [[Lunar Overture Event]]. It had a decent amount of health and a below average speed for its debut.

==Appearance==
The '''Actor1''' had black skin. It wore a brown tunic, gloves and boots, a purple hat, black pants and a black shirt with red diamonds on it. It also wore a white colored sad theater mask.

==Strategy==
*Multiple [[Minigunner]]s, [[Golden Minigunner]]s or [[Golden Soldier]]s can be quite effective against the '''Actor1'''.
**Towers like the [[Accelerator]] or [[Pursuit]] could also be useful, though they may not be as effective.
*The [[Warden]] can be effective at slowing down and damaging the '''Actor1''', though this is generally not necessary.

